@startuml
title CON-SD-D06 Projection Freshness and Degraded Eligibility Flow
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Connector reports projection facts,\nhealth, mapping, and freshness context;
:Central PMS evaluates active continuity scope;
if (Projection fresh enough by approved policy?) then (yes)
  if (Mapping unambiguous and sufficient?) then (yes)
    if (Approved degraded tariff basis exists?) then (yes)
      :Central PMS may allow controlled degraded evaluation;
    else (no)
      :Fail closed / governance review;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Fail closed / ambiguity review;
  endif
else (no)
  :Fail closed / stale warning;
endif
:Audit and reconciliation context recorded where used or rejected;
stop

note right
Projection is operational visibility and degraded support only.
It is not financial, fiscal, tariff, payment, discount, or exit truth.
end note
@enduml
